From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 20:03:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mb/lenovo/haswell: Wake from S3 on lid open and Fn key

The H8 LID and SLPB devices report GPE 0x18 (GPIO8) in _PRW, so the OS
arms GPIO8 as wake source before entering S3. On these boards the EC
wake signal is on GPIO13, i.e. GPE 0x1d: the OEM firmware of the W541
(GNETxxWW) uses 0x1d in both _PRW methods and handles it in _L1D, and
the SMI handler shared by the T440p and W541 routes GPIO13 to SCI on S3
entry when the EC wake events are enabled. As a result, opening the lid
or pressing Fn does not wake the machine from S3, only the power button
does.

Use GPE 0x1d for the EC wake on these boards. Like the OEM firmware,
read the EC wake cause (EC 0x36) in _L1D and notify the device that
caused the wake.

TEST=Built for W541 and T440p, the DSDT has 0x1d in both _PRW methods.
Not tested on hardware yet: with the lid wake enabled in
/proc/acpi/wakeup, closing the lid must suspend and opening it must
resume the machine.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/ec.asl | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/dsdt.asl    |  1 +
 2 files changed, 25 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/ec.asl b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/ec.asl
index 8dea15207..be1d7192f 100644
--- a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/ec.asl
+++ b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/ec.asl
@@ -2,3 +2,27 @@
 
 #include <ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ec.asl>
 #include <ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/thinkpad_bat_thresholds_b0.asl>
+
+Scope (EC)
+{
+	Field (ERAM, ByteAcc, NoLock, Preserve)
+	{
+		Offset (0x36),
+		HWAC, 16,	/* Wake cause */
+	}
+}
+
+/* EC wake on GPIO13 (THINKPAD_EC_WAKE_GPE), handled like the OEM firmware */
+Scope (\_GPE)
+{
+	Method (_L1D, 0, NotSerialized)
+	{
+		Local0 = \_SB.PCI0.LPCB.EC.HWAC
+		If (Local0 & 0x04) {
+			Notify (\_SB.PCI0.LPCB.EC.LID, 0x02)
+		}
+		If (Local0 & 0x98) {
+			Notify (\_SB.PCI0.LPCB.EC.SLPB, 0x02)
+		}
+	}
+}
diff --git a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/dsdt.asl b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/dsdt.asl
index 212657d7e..046584a87 100644
--- a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/dsdt.asl
+++ b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/dsdt.asl
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 #define BRIGHTNESS_UP \_SB.PCI0.GFX0.INCB
 #define BRIGHTNESS_DOWN \_SB.PCI0.GFX0.DECB
 #define THINKPAD_EC_GPE 17
+#define THINKPAD_EC_WAKE_GPE 0x1d /* GPIO13 */
 
 #include <acpi/acpi.h>
 DefinitionBlock(
-- 
